<div class="text-start container">
    <h1 class="display-4">rippin' lips</h1>
    
    <img alt="person holding a large bass" src="~/img/fishing1.jpg"/> 
    
    <img alt="person holding a large bass" src="~/img/fishing2.jpg"/>
    
    <div class="container">
        <h2>i like to catch hogs</h2>
        <p>my name is conrad, and i catch fish. i grew up on the shore of the willamette falls in oregon, usa. every morning 
            i took out my 14ft sled with the fellas and slew small and largemouth bass (largies and smallies). </p>
        <p>we found the sled on a local island. after filing a lost boat claim with the state, 
            we slapped some registration on that sucker and wasted no time getting out on the channel. at one point, we erroneously navigated 
            on the wrong side of the channel. our outdrive caught on the channel shelf and was ripped off.
            after some lucky paddling, we found the outdrive balanced on the channel's edge in 3 ft of water slowly teetering toward the 50ft drop off. 
            long story short, we recovered the outdrive, paddled home, and cleaned up the outdrive. 
            we were back to the river and catching smallies 3 hours later.</p>
    </div>
</div>